.SH NAME
le-text-epoch-to-date - Convert whole Unix seconds to ISO-8601 UTC


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBle text epoch-to-date [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert whole Unix seconds from stdin, or use --seconds.
Zero and negative seconds are supported; valid dates span years 0001 through 9999.

.PP
printf '%s' -1 | le text epoch-to-date
  le text epoch-to-date --seconds=-1


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for epoch-to-date

.PP
\fB--seconds\fP=""
	Whole Unix seconds (otherwise read stdin)


